# fourth pass: press through the story (A and START), then walk the first area, Scouter, pause, hotkeys
wait 240
mash START 6 40
mash A 200 30
mash START 40 60
shot field
hold DOWN 90
hold RIGHT 120
shot walking
press SELECT 6
wait 60
shot scouter
press SELECT 6
wait 30
press START 4
wait 60
shot pause
press B 4
wait 30
press HOME 6
wait 30
shot homemenu
press HOME 6
wait 30
press HOME+R 6
hold RIGHT 60
shot moved
press HOME+L 6
wait 10
shot loaded
press HOME+Y 6
wait 20
shot swapped
press HOME+Y 6
wait 20
shot back
